  "description": "VICJOI crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C82 H80 Eu4 N8 O34 Zn4,2(C2 H6 O1). From the CIF bond table, Eu1 (Eu) has 9 O neighbors; Eu2 (Eu) has 9 O neighbors; Zn1 (Zn) has 3 O neighbors; Zn2 (Zn) has 3 O neighbors; Eu1A (Eu) has 9 O neighbors; Eu2A (Eu) has 9 O neighbors; Zn1A (Zn) has 3 O neighbors; Zn2A (Zn) has 3 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 8 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.416-4.153 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 99.65-115.50°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Zn4L4Eu4(CO3)6]·EtOH. Article name explicitly identifies I(I), I(II).",
